<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Good Night]
[Episode 4]</font>

32
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:43,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do we always get coconut chicken?</font>

33
00:01:43,710 --> 00:01:44,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have a gift card, don't we?</font>

34
00:01:48,750 --> 00:01:50,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't we overloaded?</font>

35
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry. This van</font>

36
00:01:52,510 --> 00:01:53,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hardly ever gets checked by traffic cops.</font>

37
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:56,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That doesn't mean we can break traffic laws.</font>

38
00:01:56,870 --> 00:01:58,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your son has better manners than you.</font>

39
00:01:58,350 --> 00:02:00,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes. I could do better.</font>

40
00:02:00,150 --> 00:02:02,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why you're the boss.</font>

41
00:02:02,950 --> 00:02:03,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You little rascal.</font>

42
00:02:06,710 --> 00:02:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

43
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's been an accident.</font>

44
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you drive like that?</font>

45
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look!</font>

46
00:02:10,150 --> 00:02:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you just turn? This wouldn't have happened!</font>

47
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:11,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

48
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is your fault! You know that?</font>

49
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:13,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mine? This is your fault!</font>

50
00:02:13,570 --> 00:02:14,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you just let me through?</font>

51
00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:14,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why couldn't you have waited for me?</font>

52
00:02:14,910 --> 00:02:16,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was backing up properly! You know that?</font>

53
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Pay up! Come on, pay up!</font>

54
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:18,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was driving normally!</font>

55
00:02:18,710 --> 00:02:19,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look which lane I'm in!</font>

56
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Need a hand?</font>

57
00:02:22,050 --> 00:02:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- It's just a scrape. -It's your fault!</font>

58
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:23,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look for yourself!</font>

59
00:02:23,590 --> 00:02:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Your fault! -Is everyone okay?</font>

60
00:02:26,260 --> 00:02:26,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Qingliangshan]</font>

61
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoa.</font>

62
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Everyone's fine.
-They're from the funeral home.</font>

63
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:28,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone's fine.</font>

64
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Need a hand?</font>

65
00:02:30,470 --> 00:02:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, we're good.</font>

66
00:02:31,420 --> 00:02:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nobody's hurt, right?</font>

67
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:32,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, we're fine.</font>

68
00:02:33,010 --> 00:02:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If no one's hurt,</font>

69
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's clear the road.</font>

70
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move along.</font>

71
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:35,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

72
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

73
00:02:36,190 --> 00:02:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Look at this traffic. -Watch yourself!</font>

74
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You better hope I don't see you again!</font>

75
00:02:38,190 --> 00:02:38,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough. Drop it.</font>

76
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drop it.</font>

77
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move along. Come on.</font>

78
00:02:54,340 --> 00:02:54,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

79
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Same as always!</font>

80
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's start with some beer!</font>

81
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave it. Don't worry about it.</font>

82
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't get it. Sit down.</font>

83
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open a bottle.</font>

84
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You carried that here yourself?</font>

85
00:03:04,410 --> 00:03:05,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course!</font>

86
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun, not bad.</font>

87
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've still got some muscle.</font>

88
00:03:09,270 --> 00:03:10,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's all this?</font>

89
00:03:10,260 --> 00:03:10,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about it.</font>

90
00:03:11,430 --> 00:03:12,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe, call your dad.</font>

91
00:03:12,430 --> 00:03:13,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See where he is.</font>

92
00:03:13,550 --> 00:03:14,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang, check with your mom.</font>

93
00:03:14,670 --> 00:03:15,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

94
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:15,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shuang.</font>

95
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:20,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

96
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

97
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:21,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here we go.</font>

98
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nice!</font>

99
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Going all ceremonial, huh?</font>

100
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:33,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, let's do this.</font>

101
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:34,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheers. Cheers!</font>

102
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's got a kick.</font>

103
00:03:46,110 --> 00:03:46,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad.</font>

104
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Strong stuff.</font>

105
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:51,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here are your appetizers.</font>

106
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:53,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll get it.</font>

107
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:53,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

108
00:03:53,990 --> 00:03:54,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

109
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I say a few words?</font>

110
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait a second.</font>

111
00:03:58,150 --> 00:03:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me say something!</font>

112
00:04:00,550 --> 00:04:01,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

113
00:04:01,730 --> 00:04:03,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I invited everyone out today</font>

114
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for two reasons.</font>

115
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First,</font>

116
00:04:05,390 --> 00:04:07,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on behalf of someone on our mortuary prep team,</font>

117
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd like to apologize to Sun.</font>

118
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:12,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need. It's all good.</font>

119
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second,</font>

120
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted our new hire to join us</font>

121
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we can give him some encouragement, okay?</font>

122
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make yourself at home.</font>

123
00:04:19,350 --> 00:04:20,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao's actually splurging today.</font>

124
00:04:23,710 --> 00:04:24,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, I like this.</font>

125
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait!</font>

126
00:04:37,830 --> 00:04:38,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead. Order.</font>

127
00:04:39,790 --> 00:04:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, wait.</font>

128
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How many of us are there? Twelve chickens?</font>

129
00:04:43,590 --> 00:04:44,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we even finish that?</font>

130
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:46,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll take the leftovers home.</font>

131
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who ordered the Australian Wagyu?</font>

132
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Never had it. Wanted to try it.</font>

133
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't you curious how much it costs?</font>

134
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The price is exactly what I'm curious about.</font>

135
00:04:58,470 --> 00:04:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

136
00:04:59,350 --> 00:05:00,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this place.</font>

137
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They call it Australian Wagyu.</font>

138
00:05:01,790 --> 00:05:02,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You believe that?</font>

139
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's get something else.</font>

140
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one.</font>

141
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about the Japanese grouper?</font>

142
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've got plenty of great food right here.</font>

143
00:05:07,710 --> 00:05:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't we buy local?</font>

144
00:05:10,230 --> 00:05:11,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about this?</font>

145
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These Rushan oysters from Shandong.</font>

146
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're 48 yuan each.</font>

147
00:05:14,150 --> 00:05:14,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This one's good.</font>

148
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, this one.</font>

149
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I'll take two. - I'll take one.</font>

150
00:05:16,100 --> 00:05:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take three.</font>

151
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make mine three.</font>

152
00:05:17,320 --> 00:05:17,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take two.</font>

153
00:05:17,850 --> 00:05:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two dozen. Two dozen.</font>

154
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two dozen.</font>

155
00:05:19,030 --> 00:05:21,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does everything have to come from outside Fushan?</font>

156
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, Cao!</font>

157
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you zip it?</font>

158
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why invite the kids out if you won't let them order?</font>

159
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You won't let them order anything.</font>

160
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:30,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are they supposed to eat?</font>

161
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:31,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Order.</font>

162
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get whatever you want.</font>

163
00:05:32,270 --> 00:05:33,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is why everyone calls you cheap.</font>

164
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:37,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry, sorry.</font>

165
00:05:37,270 --> 00:05:38,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're late.</font>

166
00:05:38,910 --> 00:05:39,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chang'e.</font>

167
00:05:39,350 --> 00:05:39,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Traffic was bad.</font>

168
00:05:39,830 --> 00:05:40,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit down, sit down.</font>

169
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys already started drinking.</font>

170
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We couldn't wait. Bring out the drinks.</font>

171
00:05:43,590 --> 00:05:44,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No worries.</font>

172
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:45,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao,</font>

173
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:48,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why do you look so pale?</font>

174
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's scared.</font>

175
00:05:49,390 --> 00:05:50,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Scan the menu and see</font>

176
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:51,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what your goddaughter ordered.</font>

177
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:54,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao,</font>

178
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you call this treating everyone?</font>

179
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:56,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu,</font>

180
00:05:56,890 --> 00:05:59,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she's stocking her kitchen on your dime.</font>

181
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a devoted daughter.</font>

182
00:06:02,710 --> 00:06:03,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu.</font>

183
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:04,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's your mom?</font>

184
00:06:04,710 --> 00:06:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you bring her?</font>

185
00:06:05,790 --> 00:06:06,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should talk to her.</font>

186
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I tried. She won't listen.</font>

187
00:06:11,590 --> 00:06:12,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've tried so many times. It's no use.</font>

188
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:13,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wants to stay with my dad.</font>

189
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:21,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

190
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:22,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's still having a hard time.</font>

191
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give her time.</font>

192
00:06:23,830 --> 00:06:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once she's ready, she'll move forward.</font>

193
00:06:26,030 --> 00:06:27,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll all be here waiting for her.</font>

194
00:06:27,590 --> 00:06:28,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll set the table,</font>

195
00:06:28,470 --> 00:06:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get a card game going.</font>

196
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whenever she's up for it,</font>

197
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll all get together.</font>

198
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:33,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu,</font>

199
00:06:33,590 --> 00:06:35,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just focus on living your own life.</font>

200
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, Chang'e.</font>

201
00:06:38,030 --> 00:06:39,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why bring that up?</font>

202
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You only get one life. Live it for yourself.</font>

203
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about everything else.</font>

204
00:06:44,270 --> 00:06:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

205
00:06:45,150 --> 00:06:45,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's drink.</font>

206
00:06:45,710 --> 00:06:46,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come on, drink up. -Cheers.</font>

207
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your parents have their lives.</font>

208
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you have yours.</font>

209
00:06:50,030 --> 00:06:51,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take care of yourself.</font>

210
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at Dandan.</font>

211
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:53,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's got life figured out.</font>

212
00:06:54,470 --> 00:06:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She sure does.</font>

213
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one to worry about but herself.</font>

214
00:06:57,230 --> 00:06:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You talk way too much.</font>

215
00:06:58,590 --> 00:07:00,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? I was right to chew him out this morning.</font>

216
00:07:00,390 --> 00:07:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao, she's picking on me again.</font>

217
00:07:02,230 --> 00:07:03,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You asked for it.</font>

218
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:03,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You talk too much.</font>

219
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink.</font>

220
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I had that coming.</font>

221
00:07:06,030 --> 00:07:07,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Mom: Hexu]
Come on, let's drink.</font>

222
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Stop bringing so much food home.]
Let's drink.</font>

223
00:07:08,890 --> 00:07:10,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Your dad can't digest it well.]</font>

224
00:07:10,100 --> 00:07:11,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[He can't finish it. It always goes to waste.]</font>

225
00:07:14,910 --> 00:07:16,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you staring at? Is there something on my face?</font>

226
00:07:16,150 --> 00:07:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, cheers.</font>

227
00:07:17,350 --> 00:07:18,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Food's here.</font>

228
00:07:20,150 --> 00:07:20,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, I'll take it.</font>

229
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

230
00:07:22,150 --> 00:07:22,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excuse me.</font>

231
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:24,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How long does this need to cook?</font>

232
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About five or six minutes.</font>

233
00:07:26,030 --> 00:07:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But exactly</font>

234
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">five minutes or six?</font>

235
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:30,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This kid</font>

236
00:07:30,350 --> 00:07:31,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sure is precise.</font>

237
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So meticulous.</font>

238
00:07:35,150 --> 00:07:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

239
00:07:37,030 --> 00:07:37,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that?</font>

240
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:40,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe, do you have nothing better to do?</font>

241
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're having coconut chicken. Why'd you bring a timer?</font>

242
00:07:42,150 --> 00:07:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. You guys keep talking.</font>

243
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll handle the cooking time.</font>

244
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:46,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son</font>

245
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:47,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">takes after me.</font>

246
00:07:48,270 --> 00:07:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a stickler about everything.</font>

247
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:52,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he'd gone into research,</font>

248
00:07:53,150 --> 00:07:55,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'd probably be a scientist by now.</font>

249
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:58,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't Erzhe basically</font>

250
00:07:58,270 --> 00:07:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our team's chemist now?</font>

251
00:07:59,150 --> 00:08:00,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That embalming fluid he makes,</font>

252
00:08:00,910 --> 00:08:02,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard even embalmers from Shanghai</font>

253
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">come to him for advice.</font>

254
00:08:05,030 --> 00:08:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly. You should be proud.</font>

255
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son's even not a Fifth Level Worker.</font>

256
00:08:08,410 --> 00:08:09,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know that?</font>

257
00:08:09,150 --> 00:08:10,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Learn from them more from now on.</font>

258
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:11,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Talk shop with them.</font>

259
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And quit being so reckless.</font>

260
00:08:12,830 --> 00:08:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got that from you.</font>

261
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to you.</font>

262
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our Can</font>

263
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:18,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">got back on track and is catching up fast.</font>

264
00:08:19,030 --> 00:08:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, he used to hang around</font>

265
00:08:21,790 --> 00:08:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that bar</font>

266
00:08:23,030 --> 00:08:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and waste his time,</font>

267
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:24,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but that's all behind him.</font>

268
00:08:25,150 --> 00:08:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now he's with a proper organization like ours.</font>

269
00:08:27,910 --> 00:08:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right? Just work hard.</font>

270
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't go wrong.</font>

271
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:31,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See? You were asking for it.</font>

272
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:32,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if he's a little clueless,</font>

273
00:08:32,990 --> 00:08:34,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he's on our mortuary prep team.</font>

274
00:08:35,110 --> 00:08:36,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you from Cremation to chew him out?</font>

275
00:08:36,710 --> 00:08:37,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Business Department can.</font>

276
00:08:37,870 --> 00:08:39,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't. Got it?</font>

277
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:41,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun was asking for it.</font>

278
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:41,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

279
00:08:41,870 --> 00:08:43,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of dinner is this?</font>

280
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you supposed to apologize to me?</font>

281
00:08:45,230 --> 00:08:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why's everyone ganging up on me?</font>

282
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you tell me before</font>

283
00:08:48,750 --> 00:08:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that in Beijing,</font>

284
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was just wasting his life?</font>

285
00:08:51,110 --> 00:08:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao said that?</font>

286
00:08:54,290 --> 00:08:55,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao.</font>

287
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:55,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I never said that. -Cao.</font>

288
00:08:55,710 --> 00:08:56,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao, how could you?</font>

289
00:08:56,710 --> 00:08:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just drink!</font>

290
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't say one thing to me and another behind my back.</font>

291
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never said that!</font>

292
00:09:01,590 --> 00:09:02,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao.</font>

293
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:03,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

294
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't take it personally.</font>

295
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:09,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, none of you old-timers know how to drink.</font>

296
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:09,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

297
00:09:09,710 --> 00:09:10,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean we can't drink?</font>

298
00:09:10,790 --> 00:09:11,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just</font>

299
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pour it straight down your throat.</font>

300
00:09:14,110 --> 00:09:15,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been drinking for years.</font>

301
00:09:15,990 --> 00:09:17,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that how you drink?</font>

302
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:17,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

303
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at the beer when you pour it.</font>

304
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:20,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See all that foam?</font>

305
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's almost more foam than beer.</font>

306
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:24,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And those bubbles</font>

307
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:25,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are as big as beans.</font>

308
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We call that "crab foam".</font>

309
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It brings out all the bitterness</font>

310
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the hops.</font>

311
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could any beer taste good like that?</font>

312
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:34,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And these cups...</font>

313
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure, this place isn't exactly fancy,</font>

314
00:09:36,660 --> 00:09:38,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but beer in plastic cups?</font>

315
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At least use a glass.</font>

316
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A frosted glass straight from the freezer.</font>

317
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then pour the beer in.</font>

318
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- There's that much to it?
-Only fill it 70%.</font>

319
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:47,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The other 30% is for the foam.</font>

320
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you're done,</font>

321
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll see a ring left around the glass.</font>

322
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:51,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Know what that's called?</font>

323
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:52,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An angel ring.</font>

324
00:09:53,670 --> 00:09:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that mean?</font>

325
00:09:54,270 --> 00:09:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter how cheap the beer is,</font>

326
00:09:55,750 --> 00:09:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you pour and drink it with care,</font>

327
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can still see an angel's smile.</font>

328
00:10:00,910 --> 00:10:02,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to him. What a pro.</font>

329
00:10:02,260 --> 00:10:03,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wow, there's a lot to it.</font>

330
00:10:03,550 --> 00:10:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He makes it sound pretty good.</font>

331
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He learned this properly in Beijing.</font>

332
00:10:06,670 --> 00:10:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's legit.</font>

333
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

334
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't just</font>

335
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:10,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">talk a big game.</font>

336
00:10:10,910 --> 00:10:12,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show us how it's done.</font>

337
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can.</font>

338
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show us!</font>

339
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Make us one! - Make us one!</font>

340
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, show us!</font>

341
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:18,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't bring my bar tools.</font>

342
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell you what.</font>

343
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll ask them for a glass.</font>

344
00:10:20,690 --> 00:10:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And,</font>

345
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:22,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu, do me a favor.</font>

346
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open a beer for me.</font>

347
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I'm done, you can taste it.</font>

348
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a show-off.</font>

349
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our Wang Can learned this in Beijing.</font>

350
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was properly trained. Beer is serious business.</font>

351
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this beer</font>

352
00:10:33,910 --> 00:10:34,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tastes good,</font>

353
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it won't be because I poured it well.</font>

354
00:10:35,670 --> 00:10:36,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll be because Hexu opened it so well.</font>

355
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:37,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here it comes.</font>

356
00:10:37,670 --> 00:10:39,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, everyone. Watch and learn.</font>

357
00:10:39,270 --> 00:10:40,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the perfect 70-30 pour.</font>

358
00:10:45,270 --> 00:10:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful! Watch your hand!</font>

359
00:10:47,010 --> 00:10:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's cold.</font>

360
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

361
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wipe it on your shirt.</font>

362
00:10:49,300 --> 00:10:50,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It got a little...</font>

363
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is the chicken ready?</font>

364
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open it up. Come on.</font>

365
00:10:53,270 --> 00:10:53,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, yeah.</font>

366
00:10:53,670 --> 00:10:54,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Time's up.
- Didn't want the chicken waiting.</font>

367
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:55,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Careful, it's hot. - Here.</font>

368
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:56,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful, it's hot.</font>

369
00:10:57,420 --> 00:10:58,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Easy, easy.</font>

370
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a mess.</font>

371
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:01,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I think</font>

372
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can said something pretty good.</font>

373
00:11:03,270 --> 00:11:04,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mentioned...</font>

374
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The angel ring, right?</font>

375
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:07,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

376
00:11:07,270 --> 00:11:08,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The other thing you said.</font>

377
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:09,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Crab foam.</font>

378
00:11:10,630 --> 00:11:12,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader, order some crab.</font>

379
00:11:12,510 --> 00:11:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Crab sounds good.</font>

380
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah, crab.</font>

381
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He also mentioned an angel ring.</font>

382
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Want me to order you two angels?</font>

383
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want to learn bartending too?</font>

384
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, knock it off.</font>

385
00:11:21,750 --> 00:11:22,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan, I'm using your phone to order.</font>

386
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

387
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's too cooling!</font>

388
00:11:24,150 --> 00:11:25,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move, move.</font>

389
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:27,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go eat your crab.</font>

390
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look how cheap he is.</font>

391
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:29,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao the Cheapskate.</font>

392
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just one meal.</font>

393
00:11:31,910 --> 00:11:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

394
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:33,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat up.</font>

395
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kids these days are great.</font>

396
00:11:36,390 --> 00:11:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They bring us food</font>

397
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and pour our drinks.</font>

398
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We old-timers</font>

399
00:11:40,440 --> 00:11:41,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can finally enjoy ourselves.</font>

400
00:11:42,510 --> 00:11:43,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that Wang Can's back,</font>

401
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:46,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all our second-generation funeral workers are together.</font>

402
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our generation</font>

403
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just stumbled through life.</font>

404
00:11:48,810 --> 00:11:50,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We never paid enough attention to raising our kids.</font>

405
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I think about it,</font>

406
00:11:53,030 --> 00:11:54,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still feel guilty.</font>

407
00:11:55,630 --> 00:11:57,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't stand people who</font>

408
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get older and start getting all sentimental.</font>

409
00:11:59,150 --> 00:12:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The kids all turned out fine.</font>

410
00:12:01,550 --> 00:12:02,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Especially you!</font>

411
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink up!</font>

412
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And quit egging him on.</font>

413
00:12:04,150 --> 00:12:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, drink!</font>

414
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, hurry up!</font>

415
00:12:06,270 --> 00:12:07,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink up. Come on!</font>

416
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I read online</font>

417
00:12:11,780 --> 00:12:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that a lot of kids</font>

418
00:12:13,090 --> 00:12:14,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wait their whole lives for an apology from their parents.</font>

419
00:12:15,350 --> 00:12:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you guys?</font>

420
00:12:16,580 --> 00:12:17,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every one of you</font>

421
00:12:17,210 --> 00:12:18,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is waiting for us to say, "It's okay".</font>

422
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, Tianshuang. Enough.</font>

423
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've barely said a word all night.</font>

424
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you drop a line like that, huh?</font>

425
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:24,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

426
00:12:24,950 --> 00:12:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Us second-gen kids,</font>

427
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- let's have one too! - Come on!</font>

428
00:12:26,950 --> 00:12:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

429
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:27,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bottoms up.</font>

430
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheers.</font>

431
00:12:28,750 --> 00:12:29,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bottoms up.</font>

432
00:12:29,170 --> 00:12:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe take it easy.</font>

433
00:12:39,630 --> 00:12:41,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dad owns a restaurant.</font>

434
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:42,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dad said</font>

435
00:12:43,230 --> 00:12:44,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[My Parents]
when I have time,</font>

436
00:12:44,630 --> 00:12:46,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[18 Years Ago]
I should invite my best friends</font>

437
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to come to</font>

438
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our milk tea shop for milk tea,</font>

439
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our restaurant for pork knuckle rice,</font>

440
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:54,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or our grocery store</font>

441
00:12:54,830 --> 00:12:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and grab all the snacks they want.</font>

442
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom is an amazing</font>

443
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wedding makeup artist.</font>

444
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whenever she comes home from work,</font>

445
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she brings me lots of wedding candy.</font>

446
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I grow up...</font>

447
00:13:08,920 --> 00:13:09,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe,</font>

448
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't your dad do makeup too?</font>

449
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go up and tell us about it.</font>

450
00:13:13,710 --> 00:13:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When his dad finishes doing makeup,</font>

451
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he can't bring home wedding candy.</font>

452
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:22,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe.</font>

453
00:13:23,710 --> 00:13:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

454
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe, hurry. Come here.</font>

455
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are we at a cemetery?</font>

456
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lunch is about to start at school.</font>

457
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm starving.</font>

458
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:36,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, hurry.</font>

459
00:13:36,610 --> 00:13:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

460
00:13:40,630 --> 00:13:40,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

461
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:42,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang, where's Hexu?</font>

462
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something came up at home, so she took the day off.</font>

463
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:45,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So good.</font>

464
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's stealing stuff?</font>

465
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who stole Sun Wukong's stuff?</font>

466
00:13:54,950 --> 00:13:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at you, all scared.</font>

467
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:56,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

468
00:13:57,210 --> 00:13:58,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've got baozi too.</font>

469
00:13:58,680 --> 00:13:59,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A family gave them to us.</font>

470
00:13:59,790 --> 00:14:00,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mr. Fang.</font>

471
00:14:00,690 --> 00:14:01,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mr. Fang.</font>

472
00:14:01,710 --> 00:14:03,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take them home for dinner.</font>

473
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't forget.</font>

474
00:14:04,670 --> 00:14:05,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finish eating and get back to class.</font>

475
00:14:06,550 --> 00:14:08,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And don't rat me out.</font>

476
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can,</font>

477
00:14:11,550 --> 00:14:13,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if people really turn into ghosts,</font>

478
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and we're eating at their place,</font>

479
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">won't they mind?</font>

480
00:14:17,950 --> 00:14:19,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If ghosts really existed,</font>

481
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:21,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and our parents are here every day,</font>

482
00:14:22,070 --> 00:14:24,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they'd have friends everywhere.</font>

483
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Imagine all the connections they'd have.</font>

484
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:26,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can,</font>

485
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is it really okay</font>

486
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to eat these offerings?</font>

487
00:14:30,310 --> 00:14:31,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry!</font>

488
00:14:31,310 --> 00:14:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're not offerings. Let's save some for Hexu too.</font>

489
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

490
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:36,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're even eating offerings now?</font>

491
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you starving or what?</font>

492
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're not offerings.</font>

493
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You ran out in the middle of class?</font>

494
00:14:40,400 --> 00:14:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to drive me crazy?</font>

495
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can, wait for me.</font>

496
00:14:51,400 --> 00:14:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you okay? Slow down.</font>

497
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

498
00:14:53,540 --> 00:14:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fishing Village Restaurant]</font>

499
00:15:01,430 --> 00:15:03,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Here, yours.
- Thanks, Team Leader Cao.</font>

500
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's more.</font>

501
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Team Leader.</font>

502
00:15:07,310 --> 00:15:08,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why'd you drink so much?</font>

503
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:09,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Part of the routine.</font>

504
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow morning,</font>

505
00:15:10,770 --> 00:15:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- his wife chews him out.
-Thanks, Team Leader.</font>

506
00:15:11,840 --> 00:15:12,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Also part of the routine.</font>

507
00:15:20,910 --> 00:15:21,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no more.</font>

508
00:15:22,280 --> 00:15:22,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it!</font>

509
00:15:23,710 --> 00:15:24,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, take it.</font>

510
00:15:24,430 --> 00:15:25,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go spend it!</font>

511
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take them.</font>

512
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:28,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this taking advantage of a drunk guy?</font>

513
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:31,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should hang out with</font>

514
00:15:31,950 --> 00:15:34,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the younger ones more often.</font>

515
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:34,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got it?</font>

516
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, get going.</font>

517
00:15:37,590 --> 00:15:38,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Act like a big brother.</font>

518
00:15:39,220 --> 00:15:39,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Fishing Village Restaurant]
We're heading out.</font>

519
00:15:40,070 --> 00:15:41,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go home and pamper your wife.</font>

520
00:15:42,310 --> 00:15:42,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

521
00:15:42,830 --> 00:15:43,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bye.</font>

522
00:15:43,070 --> 00:15:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get home early, you guys.</font>

523
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Okay. - Okay.</font>

524
00:15:45,950 --> 00:15:46,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

525
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seventeen yuan.</font>

526
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go have some fun.</font>

527
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's 100 yuan.</font>

528
00:15:52,430 --> 00:15:52,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go!</font>

529
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:53,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go!</font>

530
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:10,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cao.</font>

531
00:16:10,950 --> 00:16:11,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today,</font>

532
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:13,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when she got home from preschool,</font>

533
00:16:13,430 --> 00:16:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she couldn't wait to show you this drawing.</font>

