<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you drive that vehicle?</font>

712
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

713
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then could you two make the delivery?</font>

714
00:28:35,590 --> 00:28:36,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

715
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:37,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go give them a hand.</font>

716
00:28:47,550 --> 00:28:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got it.</font>

717
00:28:48,480 --> 00:28:49,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drive carefully.</font>

718
00:28:49,550 --> 00:28:50,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't let the deceased fall.</font>

719
00:28:50,860 --> 00:28:53,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Oh, young man♪</font>

720
00:28:53,020 --> 00:28:55,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Don't go frowning now♪</font>

721
00:28:55,060 --> 00:28:56,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You come and you go♪</font>

722
00:28:56,660 --> 00:28:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Live a clean and honest life♪</font>

723
00:28:58,260 --> 00:29:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Oh, young man♪</font>

724
00:29:00,380 --> 00:29:01,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Don't ask if you should...♪</font>

725
00:29:01,760 --> 00:29:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun!</font>

726
00:29:02,580 --> 00:29:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Live it up♪</font>

727
00:29:04,060 --> 00:29:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Life has no rehearsal...♪</font>

728
00:29:06,240 --> 00:29:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two came to help too?</font>

729
00:29:08,590 --> 00:29:10,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan finally did something nice for once.</font>

730
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:11,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll keep making deliveries, then.</font>

731
00:29:11,550 --> 00:29:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, thanks.</font>

732
00:29:12,340 --> 00:29:13,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got it.</font>

733
00:29:14,980 --> 00:29:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let the rain be your shower...♪</font>

734
00:29:16,210 --> 00:29:16,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll drive.</font>

735
00:29:18,260 --> 00:29:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Take the fall as fate♪</font>

736
00:29:19,460 --> 00:29:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Lose some cash to ward off trouble♪</font>

737
00:29:32,280 --> 00:29:32,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader.</font>

738
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that guy still here?</font>

739
00:29:37,150 --> 00:29:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What guy?</font>

740
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:38,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That... That guy.</font>

741
00:29:38,590 --> 00:29:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guy over there.</font>

742
00:29:40,630 --> 00:29:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't seen him.</font>

743
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Um...</font>

744
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:48,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader.</font>

745
00:29:49,040 --> 00:29:50,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can I ask you a favor?</font>

746
00:29:50,920 --> 00:29:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we switch jobs?</font>

747
00:29:52,830 --> 00:29:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you make a few deliveries inside for me?</font>

748
00:29:55,150 --> 00:29:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll receive the bodies from the vehicles.</font>

749
00:29:57,110 --> 00:29:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That guy keeps ordering me around.</font>

750
00:29:59,280 --> 00:30:00,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't take it anymore.</font>

751
00:30:01,590 --> 00:30:02,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

752
00:30:02,040 --> 00:30:02,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Team Leader.</font>

753
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:03,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Appreciate it.</font>

754
00:30:06,350 --> 00:30:07,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's really gone?</font>

755
00:30:07,310 --> 00:30:08,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't seen him.</font>

756
00:30:40,040 --> 00:30:41,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cleansed for the final journey!</font>

757
00:31:15,870 --> 00:31:16,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

758
00:31:17,720 --> 00:31:19,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just delivered the last one.</font>

759
00:31:19,760 --> 00:31:21,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Thanks for your hard work.</font>

760
00:31:21,280 --> 00:31:21,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, right.</font>

761
00:31:21,680 --> 00:31:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go get Body 16</font>

762
00:31:23,240 --> 00:31:23,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and bring it out.</font>

763
00:31:23,870 --> 00:31:24,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need it for tomorrow morning's service.</font>

764
00:31:25,150 --> 00:31:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's frozen solid,</font>

765
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you'll need some muscle.</font>

766
00:31:26,790 --> 00:31:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful.</font>

767
00:31:27,530 --> 00:31:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

768
00:31:28,140 --> 00:31:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

769
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

770
00:31:34,520 --> 00:31:36,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's in the freezer, right?</font>

771
00:31:36,280 --> 00:31:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. Right here. Number 16.</font>

772
00:31:37,520 --> 00:31:39,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

773
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:42,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I, uh...</font>

774
00:31:42,960 --> 00:31:43,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By myself?</font>

775
00:31:44,210 --> 00:31:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can do it yourself.</font>

776
00:31:45,280 --> 00:31:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's how we all do it.</font>

777
00:31:46,550 --> 00:31:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

778
00:31:46,920 --> 00:31:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can help if you can't manage.</font>

779
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:48,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

780
00:31:48,760 --> 00:31:50,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can do it myself.</font>

781
00:31:52,240 --> 00:31:54,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll... I'll put on a mask.</font>

782
00:31:58,590 --> 00:31:59,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today's an auspicious day.</font>

783
00:31:59,630 --> 00:32:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're swamped today. Thanks for all your hard work.</font>

784
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I bought coffee. It's in the break room.</font>

785
00:32:02,550 --> 00:32:03,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can, there's one for you too.</font>

786
00:32:05,240 --> 00:32:06,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader! Team Leader!</font>

787
00:32:06,960 --> 00:32:07,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here.</font>

788
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:08,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Um...</font>

789
00:32:09,590 --> 00:32:10,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

790
00:32:10,390 --> 00:32:11,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to ask you something.</font>

791
00:32:12,390 --> 00:32:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

792
00:32:13,310 --> 00:32:14,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look,</font>

793
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:16,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been working all morning.</font>

794
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:17,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao Erzhe</font>

795
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:19,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been sitting in that room all morning.</font>

796
00:32:19,870 --> 00:32:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we switch jobs this afternoon?</font>

797
00:32:21,200 --> 00:32:23,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let him get out and do some work,</font>

798
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:24,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I'll play scientist for a while.</font>

799
00:32:25,110 --> 00:32:27,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's monitoring the embalming area's environment.</font>

800
00:32:28,390 --> 00:32:29,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the thing.</font>

801
00:32:29,150 --> 00:32:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This morning,</font>

802
00:32:29,720 --> 00:32:31,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we got a lot of elderly deceased from out of town.</font>

803
00:32:31,550 --> 00:32:33,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They'd been kept at home for quite a while.</font>

804
00:32:33,280 --> 00:32:35,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their bodies can carry pathogens.</font>

805
00:32:35,760 --> 00:32:37,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And we have to thaw bodies this afternoon,</font>

806
00:32:37,520 --> 00:32:39,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so we need to prevent cross-contamination.</font>

807
00:32:39,790 --> 00:32:41,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's doing an air impact test.</font>

808
00:32:41,070 --> 00:32:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

809
00:32:42,280 --> 00:32:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let him keep doing it.</font>

810
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:45,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who else are you going to switch with?</font>

811
00:32:45,680 --> 00:32:46,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I...</font>

812
00:32:46,680 --> 00:32:47,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not what I meant.</font>

813
00:32:47,760 --> 00:32:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just saying,</font>

814
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:49,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've done this over 30 times this morning.</font>

815
00:32:50,200 --> 00:32:51,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know what you mean.</font>

816
00:32:51,760 --> 00:32:52,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the deal.</font>

817
00:32:52,870 --> 00:32:54,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tianshuang is Fourth Level.</font>

818
00:32:54,870 --> 00:32:56,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao is Third Level.</font>

819
00:32:56,070 --> 00:32:57,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hexu is Second Level.</font>

820
00:32:57,830 --> 00:32:59,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And what level are you?</font>

821
00:33:01,150 --> 00:33:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

822
00:33:01,920 --> 00:33:03,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get it. I get it.</font>

823
00:33:03,070 --> 00:33:04,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take the exam soon.</font>

824
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:10,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just telling him something.</font>

825
00:33:11,150 --> 00:33:11,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got it.</font>

826
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got it.</font>

827
00:33:20,070 --> 00:33:21,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once this is all over,</font>

828
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get some real sleep.</font>

829
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

830
00:33:22,920 --> 00:33:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm exhausted.</font>

831
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:24,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No kidding.</font>

832
00:33:24,760 --> 00:33:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You haven't slept well either, right?</font>

833
00:33:25,790 --> 00:33:26,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

834
00:33:26,720 --> 00:33:27,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Working all day, keeping vigil all night.</font>

835
00:33:27,830 --> 00:33:28,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me about it.</font>

836
00:33:28,390 --> 00:33:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I still have to pick up the kid.</font>

837
00:33:30,070 --> 00:33:30,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was on my feet all night.</font>

838
00:33:32,150 --> 00:33:32,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, have a cigarette!</font>

839
00:33:33,240 --> 00:33:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, buddy. Have one!</font>

840
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me one.</font>

841
00:33:39,110 --> 00:33:40,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that our uncle's gone,</font>

842
00:33:40,920 --> 00:33:41,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he's finally free.</font>

843
00:33:42,590 --> 00:33:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

844
00:33:43,590 --> 00:33:44,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm kind of jealous of Uncle.</font>

845
00:33:45,790 --> 00:33:46,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

846
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unlike us,</font>

847
00:33:47,920 --> 00:33:48,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we still have to work every day.</font>

848
00:33:50,040 --> 00:33:50,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just grinding away.</font>

849
00:33:51,440 --> 00:33:52,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

850
00:33:52,390 --> 00:33:53,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Count yourself lucky.</font>

851
00:33:53,720 --> 00:33:55,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We haven't done any real heavy lifting yet.</font>

852
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing</font>

853
00:33:56,630 --> 00:33:58,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more exhausting than manual labor.</font>

854
00:33:59,830 --> 00:34:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right, buddy?</font>

855
00:34:18,800 --> 00:34:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do the hardest work underground.</font>

856
00:34:26,590 --> 00:34:27,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao.</font>

857
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

858
00:34:28,670 --> 00:34:29,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Having lunch?</font>

859
00:34:30,070 --> 00:34:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen.</font>

860
00:34:30,840 --> 00:34:32,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our team's been working hard these past few days.</font>

861
00:34:33,110 --> 00:34:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So</font>

862
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I made a special request to management</font>

863
00:34:36,270 --> 00:34:38,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and got half a Dongshan goat.</font>

864
00:34:38,590 --> 00:34:39,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This goat</font>

865
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:40,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is really good.</font>

866
00:34:40,670 --> 00:34:42,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't bring myself to cut into it.</font>

867
00:34:42,670 --> 00:34:43,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

868
00:34:43,270 --> 00:34:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's coming with me to carry it?</font>

869
00:35:02,630 --> 00:35:04,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pass on the goat.</font>

870
00:35:04,670 --> 00:35:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You guys have it.</font>

871
00:35:06,630 --> 00:35:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't stand the gamey taste.</font>

872
00:35:09,580 --> 00:35:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll eat it. I'll help carry it.</font>

873
00:35:11,520 --> 00:35:11,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

874
00:35:13,190 --> 00:35:14,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Team Leader Cao, enjoy.</font>

875
00:35:21,900 --> 00:35:22,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir.</font>

876
00:35:23,520 --> 00:35:24,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

877
00:35:24,550 --> 00:35:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not sure</font>

878
00:35:26,230 --> 00:35:27,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I should ask this.</font>

879
00:35:27,670 --> 00:35:29,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before I joined the mortuary prep team,</font>

880
00:35:30,070 --> 00:35:31,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who usually handled</font>

881
00:35:31,590 --> 00:35:33,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">moving the bodies?</font>

882
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:34,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoever was free.</font>

883
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:35,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Fang at the entrance</font>

884
00:35:36,070 --> 00:35:37,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">helped out sometimes too.</font>

885
00:35:37,270 --> 00:35:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then how come once Wang Can showed up,</font>

886
00:35:39,630 --> 00:35:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">suddenly nobody's ever free?</font>

887
00:35:43,110 --> 00:35:43,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dandan.</font>

888
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:45,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to improve fast too</font>

889
00:35:45,590 --> 00:35:46,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and become a Fifth Level Worker,</font>

890
00:35:47,040 --> 00:35:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I can do more for our team.</font>

891
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:49,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if I'm stuck</font>

892
00:35:49,710 --> 00:35:50,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doing this stuff all day,</font>

893
00:35:51,270 --> 00:35:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when am I supposed to study?</font>

894
00:35:53,110 --> 00:35:54,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Study after work.</font>

895
00:35:54,230 --> 00:35:55,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After work,</font>

896
00:35:55,270 --> 00:35:57,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all my teachers and mentors</font>

897
00:35:57,480 --> 00:35:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are already off.</font>

898
00:35:58,880 --> 00:35:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who am I supposed to learn from?</font>

899
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:01,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A mentor shows you the way.</font>

900
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:03,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The rest is up to you.</font>

901
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:04,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mentor isn't here.</font>

902
00:36:04,630 --> 00:36:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then go find him.</font>

903
00:36:24,260 --> 00:36:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Good Night Signature Cocktail - Angel's Smile]</font>

904
00:36:31,980 --> 00:36:38,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Six Years Ago]</font>

905
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:44,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ready?</font>

906
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm talking to you.</font>

907
00:36:52,440 --> 00:36:53,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't I supposed to be dead?</font>

908
00:36:53,750 --> 00:36:54,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How am I supposed to answer you?</font>

909
00:36:55,550 --> 00:36:56,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, I'm really starting now.</font>

910
00:37:08,860 --> 00:37:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you doing the facial shading?</font>

911
00:37:10,730 --> 00:37:11,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what you're doing, right?</font>

912
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:14,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll make your features look perfectly sculpted.</font>

913
00:37:14,710 --> 00:37:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Happy now?</font>

914
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:17,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

915
00:37:26,040 --> 00:37:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are tons of people in our class.</font>

916
00:37:28,550 --> 00:37:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you have to practice on me?</font>

917
00:37:31,710 --> 00:37:33,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can practice on my face later, too.</font>

918
00:37:34,750 --> 00:37:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deal?</font>

919
00:37:37,670 --> 00:37:38,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

920
00:37:39,750 --> 00:37:40,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

921
00:37:40,920 --> 00:37:41,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have a problem with me?</font>

922
00:37:44,190 --> 00:37:45,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not that.</font>

923
00:37:46,230 --> 00:37:47,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your features</font>

924
00:37:48,630 --> 00:37:49,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are pretty much perfect.</font>

925
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's not much for me to improve.</font>

926
00:38:05,270 --> 00:38:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move!</font>

927
00:38:15,750 --> 00:38:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you, I have crow's feet.</font>

928
00:38:17,550 --> 00:38:18,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd better cover them up.</font>

929
00:38:19,190 --> 00:38:21,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you can nail old-age makeup,</font>

930
00:38:21,840 --> 00:38:23,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll have a real specialty.</font>

931
00:38:25,630 --> 00:38:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You clearly weren't paying attention in class.</font>

932
00:38:27,750 --> 00:38:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The teacher said</font>

933
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:32,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wrinkles are acquired facial lines.</font>

934
00:38:32,630 --> 00:38:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You worked hard to earn them.</font>

935
00:38:33,750 --> 00:38:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're one of the few things you take with you.</font>

936
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:36,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you want me to cover them up?</font>

937
00:38:40,840 --> 00:38:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me...</font>

938
00:38:43,320 --> 00:38:44,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someday...</font>

939
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I mean...</font>

940
00:38:47,840 --> 00:38:48,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Many years from now,</font>

941
00:38:50,630 --> 00:38:52,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if that day really comes</font>

942
00:38:53,480 --> 00:38:54,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I go before you,</font>

943
00:38:56,190 --> 00:38:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will you do my makeup?</font>

944
00:38:59,590 --> 00:39:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if I go before you?</font>

945
00:39:01,070 --> 00:39:02,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll do yours.</font>

946
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:04,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That depends on whether my family agrees.</font>

947
00:39:04,840 --> 00:39:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With makeup skills like yours...</font>

948
00:39:06,110 --> 00:39:06,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I agree.</font>

949
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just said he agrees.</font>

950
00:39:33,110 --> 00:39:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know</font>

951
00:39:34,550 --> 00:39:36,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shao Yi, the sophomore in Welfare Studies?</font>

952
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:37,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

953
00:39:38,360 --> 00:39:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's he?</font>

954
00:39:42,710 --> 00:39:43,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe someday</font>

955
00:39:44,590 --> 00:39:45,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll introduce you two.</font>

956
00:39:58,140 --> 00:40:03,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Five Years Ago]</font>

957
00:40:03,550 --> 00:40:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

958
00:40:10,190 --> 00:40:11,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shao Yi said</font>

959
00:40:14,110 --> 00:40:16,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his parents already planned his future.</font>

960
00:40:17,360 --> 00:40:19,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After graduation, he'll apply to the Civil Affairs Bureau</font>

961
00:40:20,270 --> 00:40:21,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and issue marriage certificates.</font>

962
00:40:22,550 --> 00:40:23,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a secure government job.</font>

963
00:40:24,480 --> 00:40:27,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He thinks my major isn't good enough for him.</font>

964
00:40:29,630 --> 00:40:30,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we were together,</font>

965
00:40:30,710 --> 00:40:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he never said that to me.</font>

966
00:40:33,670 --> 00:40:35,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He even thought we were perfect together.</font>

967
00:40:36,150 --> 00:40:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someday,</font>

968
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'd handle weddings, and I'd handle funerals.</font>

969
00:40:40,400 --> 00:40:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'd cover every stage of life.</font>

970
00:41:03,320 --> 00:41:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't hit him!</font>

971
00:41:04,550 --> 00:41:05,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't.</font>

972
00:41:05,630 --> 00:41:06,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kick him to death!</font>

973
00:41:15,880 --> 00:41:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can, where are you going?</font>

974
00:41:17,400 --> 00:41:19,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We just bought some watermelon and stinky tofu.</font>

975
00:41:19,040 --> 00:41:20,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We came to share it with you guys.</font>

976
00:41:20,670 --> 00:41:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two have it.</font>

977
00:41:22,190 --> 00:41:23,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you seen Shao Yi?</font>

978
00:41:23,360 --> 00:41:24,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He just went toward the grove.</font>

979
00:41:24,750 --> 00:41:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That way?</font>

980
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

981
00:41:26,710 --> 00:41:28,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can, don't do anything rash.</font>

982
00:41:28,920 --> 00:41:30,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. You can't hit someone with that.</font>

983
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This?</font>

984
00:41:32,320 --> 00:41:32,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

985
00:41:34,320 --> 00:41:35,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shao Yi!</font>

986
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh...</font>

987
00:41:39,590 --> 00:41:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on!</font>

988
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:41,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You!</font>

989
00:41:45,920 --> 00:41:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you looking for a fight?</font>

990
00:41:48,440 --> 00:41:49,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No!</font>

991
00:41:49,710 --> 00:41:51,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can, I'm here!</font>

992
00:41:54,360 --> 00:41:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of Can!</font>

993
00:42:08,550 --> 00:42:09,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you I'm not...</font>

994
00:42:11,710 --> 00:42:12,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang Can!</font>

995
00:42:20,000 --> 00:42:20,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shao Yi!</font>

996
00:42:21,520 --> 00:42:22,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shao Yi!</font>

997
00:43:01,380 --> 00:43:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I drift along through time♪</font>

998
00:43:04,740 --> 00:43:08,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And let memory's tenderness♪</font>

999
00:43:08,020 --> 00:43:11,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Carry me to freedom♪</font>

1000
00:43:12,700 --> 00:43:15,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In my panic, I hold on tight♪</font>

1001
00:43:16,060 --> 00:43:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪As if I've gained nothing at all♪</font>

1002
00:43:18,500 --> 00:43:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I get lonely, I make mistakes♪</font>

1003
00:43:23,860 --> 00:43:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In an embrace, I feel boundless♪</font>

1004
00:43:27,220 --> 00:43:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Grateful for those hands♪</font>

1005
00:43:30,180 --> 00:43:33,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪That hold me like the sky♪</font>

1006
00:43:33,620 --> 00:43:35,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In every♪</font>

1007
00:43:35,940 --> 00:43:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Moment of missing you♪</font>

1008
00:43:38,420 --> 00:43:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I linger there awhile♪</font>

1009
00:43:45,300 --> 00:43:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I look up at the stars♪</font>

1010
00:43:49,140 --> 00:43:52,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Who hasn't stumbled bravely on♪</font>

1011
00:43:52,620 --> 00:43:55,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Chasing the ever-changing sky?♪</font>

1012
00:43:56,460 --> 00:43:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this earthly life♪</font>

1013
00:44:00,460 --> 00:44:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Who hasn't faced the wind despite the pain♪</font>

1014
00:44:03,860 --> 00:44:07,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Holding fast to love and what we have?♪</font>

1015
00:44:08,260 --> 00:44:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I have loved deeply♪</font>

1016
00:44:11,740 --> 00:44:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Yet I must say goodbye and let go♪</font>

1017
00:44:15,220 --> 00:44:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And learn what it means to be moved♪</font>

1018
00:44:18,220 --> 00:44:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪What it means to love and to dream♪</font>

1019
00:44:21,180 --> 00:44:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In the universe that bears my name♪</font>

1020
00:44:31,540 --> 00:44:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I have loved deeply♪</font>

1021
00:44:35,020 --> 00:44:38,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Yet I must say goodbye and let go♪</font>

1022
00:44:38,500 --> 00:44:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪And learn what it means to be moved♪</font>

1023
00:44:41,500 --> 00:44:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪What it means to love and to dream♪</font>

1024
00:44:44,420 --> 00:44:49,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In the universe that bears my name♪</font>
